; Training dummy. Built from exactly the same combat components as the player
; — Health, Hurtbox, Hitbox, MeleeAttack, HitReaction, CharacterMotor — which
; is the whole point: if the dummy needed special-case code, the components
; would be player code wearing a disguise.
;
; It is a CharacterBody3D rather than a StaticBody3D so knockback is visible.
; It never walks anywhere; Brain only rotates it and triggers swings.
;
; Its swing is slow on purpose (0.45s windup) so there is time to raise a guard
; and actually test blocking.
[gd_scene load_steps=16 format=3]

